<title>UK: B.A.T pretax profits up in year.</title>
<headline>B.A.T pretax profits up in year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		48.6		   vs 47.7</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 26.00		  vs 24.00</p>
<p> Additional FID payment 3.50 (pence)	 vs 3.69 (pence)</p>
<p> Pretax		     2.495 bln	    vs 2.384 bln</p>
<p> Turnover		   24.47 bln	    vs 23.38 bln</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 2.586 bln and 2.717 bln stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - B.A.T Industries Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
